nt dirigés par le Président, et à défaut par le Vice-Président; en cas d'empêchement par le plus ancien des juges présents.","en":"The Proceedings shall be under the direction of the President, or, in his absence, of the Vice-President; if both are absent, the senior judge shall preside.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":75,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4559,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0578.16","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":578,"printed":568,"texts":{"fr":"L'audience est publique, à moins qu'il n'en soit autrement décidé par la Cour, à la demande de l'une des parties.","en":"The hearing in Court shall be public, unless the Court, at the written request of one of the parties, shall otherwise decide.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":77,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4561,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0578.18","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":578,"printed":568,"texts":{"fr":"Il est tenu de chaque audience un procès-verbal, signé par le Greffier et le Président.","en":"Minutes shall be made at each hearing and signed by the Registrar and the President.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":87,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4562,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0578.19","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":578,"printed":568,"texts":{"fr":"Ce procès-verbal a seul caractère authentique.","en":"These minutes shall be the only authentic record.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":46,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4563,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.02","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"La Cour peut, même avant tout débat, demander aux agents de lui produire tous actes, et de fournir toutes explications.","en":"The Court may, even before the hearing begins, call upon the agents to produce any document or to supply to the Court any explanations.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":119,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4564,"start":37}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.05","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"A tout moment, la Cour peut confier une requête ou expertise à une ou plusieurs personnes de son choix.","en":"The Court may, at any time, entrust one or more persons whom it may select, with the task of carrying out an inquiry or giving an expert opinion.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":103,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4565,"start":15}]}]},{"meeting":28,"section":"28","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0599.07","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":599,"printed":589,"texts":{"fr":"Article 7.","en":"Article 7.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":9,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4764,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0599.09","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":599,"printed":589,"texts":{"fr":"Article 8.","en":"Article 8.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-7-11","weight":1.0,"end":9,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4765,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0599.11","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":599,"printed":589,"texts":{"fr":"Article 9.","en":"Article 9.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.dr